// Percentage-closer filtering of a shadow map over a Poisson disc: the receiver's depth compared at 25 or 64 points
// spread over a radius in shadow-map uv; points off the map's edge count as shadowed. Ours, in place of the old
// pcss.fxc: the same disc points, structure and results. Shares its include guard.
#ifndef PCSS_FXC
#define PCSS_FXC

// The discs' points, in [-1, 1]
